# agent/agent.jar IS committed: it is the embedded payload `pilotdroid-cli
# setup` pushes when no --jar is given (include_bytes! in manager.rs).
# Rebuild it via agent/scripts/deploy-agent.sh after touching Agent.java,
# then `git add agent/agent.jar` — the `*.jar` glob above is overridden by:
!agent/agent.jar
agent/data/verify-*.json
